The code in this package is NetNet's. The models and sprites the manifest
lists are third-party art under CC0 1.0 (public domain dedication), listed
per pack below with where each licence was verified. No art file is
committed to this repository except the small fixture subset in
fixtures/ (three files, CC0, from the packs below). Everything else is
fetched from each pack's source by scripts/fetch.ts and optimized by the
assets service.

